 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Stepmother Loves Harem"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "계모는 하렘을 좋아해"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "But Sharuen is your adopted daughter! What about me?”\n\nEliana, the eldest daughter of a impoverished noble family, is overjoyed when she receives a marriage proposal from the wealthy Baron Karman.\n\nOn her thrilling first night, filled with hope, she is struck by thunderous words from her husband, Baron Karman: he loves another woman—even his adopted daughter, Sharuen.\n\nTo make matters worse, she is falsely accused of being a wicked stepmother due to Sharuen’s schemes…\n\n“Rumors shouldn’t be spread half-heartedly, Sharuen.”\n\nTurning crisis into opportunity, Eliana, now burdened with every rumor, sets her sights on becoming the Queen of the Harem. In this perilous quest to build a harem, will she achieve her revenge and find true love?"
  },
